#: ../../examples/custom-storage.rst:2
msgid "Implement session storage from scratch"
msgstr "从零实现会话存储"

#: ../../examples/custom-storage.rst:4
msgid "Keep every session in one JSON file and let the persistence extension own the lifecycle: restore context, append the immutable Raw Log, and save a compaction checkpoint."
msgstr "把每个会话保存在一个 JSON 文件里，让持久化扩展接管生命周期：恢复上下文、追加不可变的原始日志，以及保存压缩检查点。"

