msgstr "输出为："

#: ../../examples/custom-storage.rst:23
msgid "The program uses a deterministic offline model and a temporary directory. It requires no API key and is executed by the documentation test suite."
msgstr "这个程序使用确定性的离线模型和临时目录，不需要 API 密钥，并由文档测试套件执行。"

#: ../../examples/custom-storage.rst:27
msgid "What the program shows"
msgstr "这个程序展示了什么"

#: ../../examples/custom-storage.rst:29
msgid "``JsonFileStorage`` implements three asynchronous operations — ``load``, ``append``, and ``snapshot`` — over a dictionary that is written to disk after every change. ``JsonPersistence`` only passes it to the base extension, which supplies everything else: when to restore, what to append, and when to compact."
msgstr "``JsonFileStorage``\\ 在一个字典上实现了三个异步操作 —— ``load``\\ 、``append``\\ 与 ``snapshot``\\ —— 每次变更后都会写入磁盘。\\ ``JsonPersistence``\\ 只负责把它交给基类扩展，其余一切由基类提供：何时恢复、追加什么、何时压缩。"

#: ../../examples/custom-storage.rst:34
msgid "The final assertion reopens the file with a fresh storage instance. That is the part a real deployment cares about: the next process must see the same conversation, in the same order, with the same compaction boundary."
msgstr "最后的断言用一个全新的存储实例重新打开文件。这正是真实部署关心的部分：下一个进程必须看到同样的会话、同样的顺序，以及同样的压缩边界。"

