msgid "Next: :doc:`../extending/storage-adapter` explains each operation and the invariants to keep, or :doc:`../learn/storage` covers the SQLite, MySQL, and PostgreSQL storage that ships with the runtime."
msgstr "下一步：:doc:`../extending/storage-adapter`\\ 讲解每个操作和必须保持的不变量；:doc:`../learn/storage`\\ 则介绍运行时自带的 SQLite、MySQL 与 PostgreSQL 存储。"

